 # release executable, in a directory it stages with voinc, io.voinc.voinc.desktop,
 # the hicolor icons, voinc.service, LICENSE, and the postinst/postrm scripts. They install what the AUR package voinc-bin does:
 # /usr/bin/voinc, the desktop entry, and the systemd user unit. Voinc never
-# replaces a package-managed executable; it shows the update command the
